WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
Would you buy a new car knowing it didn't come with airbags?

2
00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:08.480
How about seatbelts, headlights, brakes? Of course not. These are safety features that

3
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:12.560
have become standard and should be expected to be included in the purchase of any new car.

4
00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:17.360
Like those important safety features in your car, living benefits are absolutely crucial

5
00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:21.920
features that should come included in any life insurance plan you own. They ensure that you

6
00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:26.160
can get your hands on money from your policy while you're still alive if you need it.

7
00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:30.400
However, most life insurance policies do not automatically include these living benefits

8
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:35.200
features even though they don't cost anything to add. That's why it's so important for you to

9
00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:39.600
know to ask for them by name and make sure that they are included on any coverage you

10
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:44.880
might be considering or already owned. Like airbags, living benefits can save your life

11
00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:49.040
and should be expected to come standard on any modern life insurance policy.

12
00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:51.600
Talk to the person who shared this video with you to make sure that

13
00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:59.440
living benefits are included with your coverage.
